      <dico>Lessing</dico>
      <unicode>ᠪᠠᠷ</unicode>
      <uighur>ber</uighur>
      <transcript>BER</transcript>
      <definition>1[ijer after consonants] Suffix of the instrumental case: It denotes the instrument or agent of the action ("With, ". "by"), the material of which something is made ( "of" ), the manner, way, or period of time in which the action is performed or takes place; after names of .professions it means "in the capacity of" or "as"; after a future noun it means "in order to ."</definition>
      <page>99</page>
